WEBVTT

01:29.300 --> 01:34.380
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.950 --> 01:37.990
[Episode 20]

02:27.940 --> 02:28.670
Hello?

02:30.579 --> 02:31.240
Why haven't I heard from you

02:31.240 --> 02:32.150
all afternoon?

02:36.570 --> 02:37.480
I fell asleep.

02:41.600 --> 02:43.260
I'll be discharged tomorrow.

02:50.990 --> 02:51.810
I know.

02:56.150 --> 02:57.180
Come pick me up.

03:00.650 --> 03:01.320
Okay.

04:28.020 --> 04:30.920
[Inpatient Building]

04:35.710 --> 04:36.550
Can you do it?

04:37.310 --> 04:38.310
Of course I can.

04:38.850 --> 04:39.390
I always trim

04:39.390 --> 04:40.270
my own hair.

04:41.390 --> 04:42.210
Don't worry.

04:42.480 --> 04:43.740
I can definitely do it.

04:44.360 --> 04:45.850
Your hair is too long.

04:46.050 --> 04:49.180
Don't you find it annoying
that it's covering your eyes?

04:49.390 --> 04:50.850
It's bit annoying indeed.

05:02.120 --> 05:03.060
I think

05:04.060 --> 05:06.030
you'd look good with long hair, too.

05:06.030 --> 05:07.020
I don't want that.

05:07.020 --> 05:08.280
It's too much trouble.

05:11.320 --> 05:12.450
Don't blow your bangs.

05:12.450 --> 05:12.910
Come on.

05:13.390 --> 05:14.310
I'll sweep the hair away

05:14.310 --> 05:15.160
later.

05:56.200 --> 05:56.880
How is it?

05:57.190 --> 05:58.190
Does it look good?

06:03.320 --> 06:05.450
These are your little hair clippings.

06:07.280 --> 06:08.280
What are they for?

06:08.760 --> 06:10.290
Keeping them as souvenirs?

06:31.090 --> 06:33.020
Let's go downstairs and sunbathe.

06:36.159 --> 06:36.770
Okay.

06:40.720 --> 06:41.980
Let me untie it for you.

07:02.880 --> 07:04.680
After I'm discharged tomorrow,

07:05.450 --> 07:06.630
you can be

07:06.630 --> 07:08.360
with your boyfriend every day.

07:09.200 --> 07:10.000
Are you happy?

07:12.840 --> 07:14.450
Are you happy?

07:15.720 --> 07:16.390
There's a more

07:16.390 --> 07:17.720
beautiful place ahead.

07:18.730 --> 07:20.790
You haven't been here before, right?

07:20.960 --> 07:22.890
I really haven't been here before.

07:33.270 --> 07:34.330
It's so beautiful.

07:39.350 --> 07:39.940
It's fine.

07:39.940 --> 07:40.670
I can do this.

07:46.270 --> 07:48.400
I told you we should come out for a walk.

08:01.500 --> 08:02.290
Lu Xixiao.

08:06.020 --> 08:06.850
Let's...

08:08.760 --> 08:09.910
play hide and seek.

08:09.910 --> 08:10.470
Okay?

08:11.000 --> 08:12.660
You want to play hide and seek?

08:13.000 --> 08:13.790
Why do you suddenly want to play

08:13.790 --> 08:14.640
hide and seek?

08:20.590 --> 08:21.440
Do you remember

08:21.440 --> 08:23.120
what I told you before?

08:27.470 --> 08:28.400
What did you say?

08:32.210 --> 08:34.520
♪ People ask me how to heal ♪

08:35.470 --> 08:37.890
You need to go see the vast world,

08:36.929 --> 08:40.120
♪ But what's the point
of questioning the leaving? ♪

08:39.039 --> 08:40.679
walk on a broad road,

08:42.890 --> 08:44.140
be happy every day

08:44.200 --> 08:46.660
♪ Naiveness is always used
in the wrong place ♪

08:45.550 --> 08:46.950
and stay safe every year.

08:48.470 --> 08:49.610
Why are you suddenly talking about this,

08:49.610 --> 08:50.470
silly girl?

08:49.760 --> 08:52.770
♪ Sadly, I didn't notice anything ♪

08:52.630 --> 08:54.960
To congratulate you on being discharged.

08:59.510 --> 09:00.800
I'm going to hide now.

09:00.350 --> 09:02.000
♪ The panic in your steps ♪

09:01.730 --> 09:03.230
You have to close your eyes.

09:03.170 --> 09:05.030
♪ Is the symphony named betrayal ♪

09:03.630 --> 09:05.110
You are so childish.

09:05.110 --> 09:06.240
Close your eyes now.

09:06.370 --> 09:07.150
Okay, okay, okay.

09:07.150 --> 09:07.680
Okay, okay.

09:07.680 --> 09:08.870
I've closed my eyes.

09:12.850 --> 09:14.520
♪ Your silent answer ♪

09:14.560 --> 09:15.860
I'll count down from ten.

09:15.850 --> 09:20.030
♪ Is the confusion
that pushed me to the valley bottom ♪

09:18.560 --> 09:19.350
Ten.

09:21.310 --> 09:23.330
♪ Me and myself ♪

09:21.320 --> 09:22.050
Nine.

09:23.870 --> 09:24.750
Eight.

09:24.910 --> 09:26.470
♪ The unsettled self ♪

09:26.510 --> 09:27.470
Seven.

09:27.690 --> 09:29.370
♪ Dancing at night ♪

09:29.030 --> 09:29.960
Six, five, four!

09:29.520 --> 09:32.220
♪ I want to calm my broken heart ♪

09:31.590 --> 09:32.800
Three.

09:33.780 --> 09:35.510
♪ Looking at myself ♪

09:34.080 --> 09:34.680
Two.

09:36.440 --> 09:37.440
I'm coming.

09:36.960 --> 09:38.730
♪ With those traces of being teased ♪

09:38.990 --> 09:39.870
Lu Xixiao!

09:39.790 --> 09:44.630
♪ I want to show my love
but I always step on the glass ♪

09:45.830 --> 09:46.750
I'm coming.

09:46.240 --> 09:47.860
♪ If promises can't be broken ♪

09:46.750 --> 09:47.680
Lu Xixiao!

09:50.990 --> 09:52.230
I lied to you.

09:52.330 --> 09:54.170
♪ If true love can't be abandoned ♪

09:56.200 --> 09:57.870
I don't love you at all.

09:57.320 --> 10:00.470
♪ I'm the only one left to heal myself ♪

10:00.230 --> 10:01.320
Since the first day I approached you,

10:01.320 --> 10:02.080
my purpose has always been

10:02.080 --> 10:03.880
asking Guo Xiangling for money.

10:04.740 --> 10:06.370
♪ People ask me how to heal ♪

10:05.140 --> 10:06.540
I went to Yicheng with you

10:07.800 --> 10:08.800
because I just wanted to

10:08.800 --> 10:09.870
escape from all of this, too.

10:09.460 --> 10:12.650
♪ But what's the use of waking up the one
who pretends to be drunk? ♪

10:10.510 --> 10:11.080
Even when I

10:11.080 --> 10:11.830
told you that

10:11.830 --> 10:13.470
I didn't make a deal with your dad,

10:13.470 --> 10:16.080
-it was also a lie.
-What are you talking about, Zhou Wan?

10:16.080 --> 10:17.160
I lied to you about everything.

10:16.720 --> 10:19.180
♪ Expectation are always used
on the wrong occasions ♪

10:17.160 --> 10:18.420
Stop talking about it!

10:18.590 --> 10:19.800
I knew you wouldn't go,

10:19.800 --> 10:21.230
so I tried every means

10:21.230 --> 10:22.110
to make you go.

10:22.290 --> 10:24.630
♪ Sadly, I didn't reject anything ♪

10:22.510 --> 10:24.110
I've been using you

10:24.110 --> 10:25.960
from beginning to end.

10:29.560 --> 10:30.200
Zhou Wan.

10:30.470 --> 10:31.350
Come out
and tell me whatever you want to say.

10:31.350 --> 10:32.280
Okay, Zhou Wan?

10:32.470 --> 10:33.470
Come out first.

10:32.610 --> 10:34.230
♪ The panic in your steps ♪

10:33.750 --> 10:34.630
Zhou Wan!

10:35.500 --> 10:37.330
♪ Is the symphony named betrayal ♪

10:36.680 --> 10:38.230
You can hate me.

10:38.440 --> 10:40.020
Just forget about me.

10:40.630 --> 10:42.090
What do you mean, Zhou Wan?

10:42.930 --> 10:43.770
Come out!

10:45.160 --> 10:46.570
♪ Your silent answer ♪

10:48.210 --> 10:52.260
♪ Is the confusion
that pushed me to the valley bottom ♪

10:53.740 --> 10:55.420
♪ Me and myself ♪

10:56.480 --> 10:57.810
Let's break up.

