12:52.540 --> 13:00.020
[Welcome to Grammy Music Bar]

12:54.710 --> 12:55.680
Drink slowly.

13:18.750 --> 13:19.590
Thank you!

13:19.590 --> 13:21.120
Don't drink too much. Okay?

13:21.590 --> 13:22.420
Drink slowly.

13:23.990 --> 13:24.350
Well...

13:24.350 --> 13:25.800
I understand you're in a bad mood.

13:25.800 --> 13:27.040
You've just recovered.

13:27.040 --> 13:28.330
Can you drink less?

13:32.400 --> 13:33.350
In a relationship,

13:33.350 --> 13:35.350
having an argument is quite normal.

13:36.080 --> 13:37.230
Just butter her up a bit.

13:37.230 --> 13:38.680
Wait a few days

13:39.590 --> 13:40.590
till you both calm down,

13:40.590 --> 13:41.400
and then just go butter her up.

13:41.400 --> 13:42.830
Gu Meng and I are like this, too.

13:42.830 --> 13:44.430
Good evening, everyone.

13:44.630 --> 13:46.140
My name is Lin Na.

13:46.400 --> 13:48.280
I'd like to sing a song

13:48.510 --> 13:50.040
and dedicate it to someone.

13:51.990 --> 13:54.710
He happens to be here today.

13:55.280 --> 13:56.160
And tonight

13:56.440 --> 13:59.160
happens to be a Sunday night.

13:59.440 --> 14:01.200
-Are you alright?
-So I'd like to sing a song called...

14:01.200 --> 14:03.510
"A Date on Sunday Night."

14:02.410 --> 14:04.770
[Welcome to Grammy Music Bar]

14:03.510 --> 14:05.490
It's dedicated to

14:07.320 --> 14:07.990
Lu Xixiao.

14:23.280 --> 14:24.140
Do you know her?

14:28.110 --> 14:29.560
She seems to be from Yangming, too.

14:29.560 --> 14:32.040
♪ Lighting a candle ♪

14:32.920 --> 14:35.590
♪ Let it illuminate his face ♪

14:35.750 --> 14:37.300
