14:35.870 --> 14:38.350
♪ If your voice is hoarse ♪

14:38.590 --> 14:41.870
♪ It'll lead to more imaginations ♪

14:43.080 --> 14:45.800
♪ The warm night breeze ♪

14:43.870 --> 14:48.970
[Welcome to Grammy Music Bar]

14:46.470 --> 14:49.350
