14:49.710 --> 14:52.130
♪ Wet clothes ♪

14:52.440 --> 14:55.870
♪ Flowing waves ♪

14:56.680 --> 14:59.590
♪ Don't think about tomorrow ♪

14:59.590 --> 15:02.750
