will pass in an instant ♪

15:01.120 --> 15:02.630
She sings pretty well.

15:03.110 --> 15:05.590
♪ Listen to a long joke ♪

15:06.680 --> 15:09.590
♪ Fill up all the cracks ♪

15:09.800 --> 15:13.080
♪ I don't want to live a wandering life ♪

15:13.470 --> 15:16.630
♪ I don't care what belief he has ♪

15:16.830 --> 15:19.960
♪ What does the world
have to do with me? ♪

15:20.370 --> 15:23.530
