15:20.750 --> 15:21.560
It's late now.

15:22.230 --> 15:24.510
Let's have a few more drinks and leave.

15:23.800 --> 15:26.300
♪ His obsession ♪

15:24.510 --> 15:25.290
Okay?

15:27.680 --> 15:30.560
♪ Let me treasure all this in my heart ♪

15:30.920 --> 15:32.950
