15:32.990 --> 15:36.710
♪ Let me finish this cigarette ♪

15:34.680 --> 15:36.510
Drink slowly.

15:37.440 --> 15:39.870
♪ Just stay here with me ♪

15:41.420 --> 15:43.870
♪ Even if we just wander around ♪

15:42.080 --> 15:43.200
What are you doing?

15:44.630 --> 15:46.900
♪ And do nothing ♪

15:45.680 --> 15:46.750
I can understand

15:46.750 --> 15:47.920
you're in a bad mood.

15:47.020 --> 15:48.700
♪ Go on a date with me ♪

15:47.920 --> 15:50.040
But you've just recovered.

15:48.780 --> 15:54.160
♪ On this Sunday night ♪

15:59.210 --> 16:05.350
[Sent a new message]

16:03.440 --> 16:04.230
Lu Xixiao.

16:04.830 --> 16:06.160
I know you don't know me.

16:05.470 --> 16:06.780
[Lu Xixiao, this is the money you lent me.
I don't think it's enough.]

16:06.800 --> 16:07.740
[But this is all I have now.]

16:07.280 --> 16:08.320
However...

16:07.760 --> 16:08.640
[I'll return the rest to you later.]

16:09.470 --> 16:11.530
I've had a crush on you for a long time.

16:15.160 --> 16:16.200
So,

16:17.830 --> 16:20.000
would you like to go on a date with me?

16:24.200 --> 16:27.630
A date! A date! A date!

16:27.650 --> 16:30.850
A date! A date! A date!

16:30.880 --> 16:33.840
A date! A date! A date!

16:33.860 --> 16:36.930
A date! A date! A date!

16:36.960 --> 16:39.940
A date! A date! A date!

16:39.010 --> 16:39.780
[Please receive the money.]

16:39.960 --> 16:42.810
A date! A date! A date!

16:40.030 --> 16:40.450
[Loading]

16:40.550 --> 16:41.390
[Receive Money]

16:41.420 --> 16:42.250
[Loading]

16:42.250 --> 16:42.690
