16:42.830 --> 16:45.550
A date! A date! A date!

16:45.570 --> 16:46.440
A date!

16:46.440 --> 16:47.770
No, no. Thanks, thanks.

16:47.860 --> 16:48.590
No need.

16:48.610 --> 16:49.670
Thank you. Thanks.

16:56.180 --> 16:56.820
Sure.

17:01.400 --> 17:02.350
Come on. Let's go.

17:02.350 --> 17:03.620
Let's go home.

17:04.599 --> 17:05.400
You're drunk.

17:10.550 --> 17:10.960
Come on.

17:10.960 --> 17:11.760
Let's go home.

17:37.470 --> 17:39.280
[Slow down, Xiaoliu.]

17:47.040 --> 17:48.950
[From now on, I'm your sister.
Call me Sister.]

17:51.320 --> 17:53.390
[Don't try to
establish a relationship with it.]

17:56.070 --> 17:56.940
[You're so handsome.]

17:56.970 --> 17:58.150
[I thought it'd be fun to date you.]

17:58.210 --> 17:59.710
[This is so boring.]

18:02.660 --> 18:04.750
[The end.]

18:06.120 --> 18:07.850
So you can't endure it already?

18:09.640 --> 18:11.460
I think he's even more interesting now.

18:11.460 --> 18:18.750
