33:46.070 --> 33:46.710
Morning, Coach.

33:46.710 --> 33:47.600
Morning.

33:50.980 --> 33:51.920
Mr. Niu.

33:51.950 --> 33:53.070
Ms. Zhou Wan has said that

33:53.070 --> 33:54.400
although the rival company

33:54.400 --> 33:55.670
