never experienced such big occasions.

34:03.160 --> 34:04.470
But Ms. Zhou Wan has also said that

34:04.470 --> 34:05.960
the rival company operates with

34:05.960 --> 34:07.470
e-commerce platforms and brand marketing

34:07.470 --> 34:08.469
