34:12.840 --> 34:13.510
What do you know?

34:13.510 --> 34:15.570
You always make a fuss about nothing.

34:20.800 --> 34:21.880
Ms. Zhou Wan has also said...

34:21.880 --> 34:22.400
Zhou Wan, Zhou Wan...

34:22.400 --> 34:23.469
Don't always talk about Zhou Wan.

34:23.469 --> 34:25.000
Is she the manager or am I?

34:25.239 --> 34:25.800
