34:26.920 --> 34:29.320
You always
trust and listen to her blindly.

34:31.280 --> 34:31.940
Besides...

34:32.630 --> 34:33.150
Let me tell you.

34:33.150 --> 34:34.280
I've been in this industry

34:34.280 --> 34:35.469
