34:35.469 --> 34:36.620
The Bid Presentation Meeting
is about to start.

34:36.620 --> 34:37.719
Where is Zhou Wan?

34:37.760 --> 34:38.840
I'll call her right now.

34:38.840 --> 34:39.400
Hurry up.

34:58.870 --> 35:00.880
How dare she even be late
for the Bid Presentation Meeting?

35:00.880 --> 35:01.760
That top student

35:01.760 --> 35:03.320
is really putting on airs.

35:04.240 --> 35:05.070
What are you nervous about?

35:05.070 --> 35:05.720
What are you nervous about?

35:05.720 --> 35:06.770
Why are you nervous?

35:06.770 --> 35:08.670
Hurry up! Keep looking for her!

35:10.730 --> 35:11.750
I'm old now.

35:12.640 --> 35:14.500
I'm no match for you guys anymore.

35:28.190 --> 35:28.920
Good shot!

35:31.580 --> 35:33.510
I still can't get in touch with her.

35:33.960 --> 35:35.400
From today onwards,

35:35.470 --> 35:36.440
Zhou Wan is no longer

35:36.440 --> 35:37.770
