35:39.720 --> 35:40.920
Mr. Zhang Jr. is here.

35:43.030 --> 35:43.670
Later,

35:43.670 --> 35:44.610
this proposal presentation...

35:43.840 --> 35:49.300
[Boxing Construction]

35:44.670 --> 35:46.320
well, w-will be entrusted to you.

35:46.320 --> 35:47.150
I...

35:47.150 --> 35:48.840
-I really can't do it.
-That's it.

35:48.840 --> 35:49.590
Mr. Niu.

35:49.590 --> 35:50.560
-You can definitely do it.
-Mr. Niu.

35:50.560 --> 35:51.350
Hurry up.

35:52.440 --> 35:53.880
Mr. Niu, you've been in this industry

35:53.880 --> 35:55.070
much longer than I have.

35:55.070 --> 35:57.330
I'll give you a promotion and a pay raise.

35:57.560 --> 35:59.380
[Xingrong Construction]

35:59.490 --> 36:00.040
[Wantuo Real Estate]

36:00.070 --> 36:01.160
[Project Cooperation Proposal Presentation
and Communication Seminar]

36:00.960 --> 36:01.820
Shall we begin?

36:02.030 --> 36:02.760
Let's begin.

36:03.760 --> 36:04.720
Wantuo Group's

36:04.630 --> 36:06.420
[Boxing Construction]

36:04.800 --> 36:06.550
Bid Presentation Meeting
for the West Coast Town Project

36:06.550 --> 36:07.630
begins now.

36:07.830 --> 36:09.380
[Xingrong Construction]

36:11.440 --> 36:12.550
Wantuo Group.

36:12.600 --> 36:14.460
We're from Boxing Construction.

36:14.510 --> 36:15.280
Miss,

36:17.510 --> 36:18.710
you play really well.

36:19.000 --> 36:20.860
As for that shot of yours just now,

36:21.070 --> 36:23.070
even if the opponent could catch it,

36:23.280 --> 36:25.320
he probably wouldn't
be able to hit it back.

36:25.320 --> 36:26.190
Thank you.

36:27.660 --> 36:28.630
I've long heard that

36:28.630 --> 36:30.560
you are the real master, Mr. Zhang.

36:30.720 --> 36:31.920
You can surely see through

36:31.920 --> 36:33.450
these small tricks of mine.

36:33.840 --> 36:35.110
You know me?

36:36.910 --> 36:37.820
How about

36:37.850 --> 36:39.590
we play a round together?

36:40.920 --> 36:42.650
I'm here to look for you indeed.

36:42.690 --> 36:44.620
We can have a tennis match anytime.

36:45.070 --> 36:46.070
But Wantuo Group's

36:46.070 --> 36:47.400
West Coast Town Project

36:47.840 --> 36:48.800
will fail at the last stage

36:48.800 --> 36:49.800
after today.

36:52.130 --> 36:58.110
[Xingrong Construction]

36:58.110 --> 37:01.340
[Boxing Construction]

37:01.480 --> 37:04.860
[Evaluator, Wantuo Real Estate]

37:04.950 --> 37:05.440
[Wantuo Real Estate]

37:05.470 --> 37:06.180
[Project Cooperation Proposal Presentation
and Communication Seminar]

37:06.200 --> 37:06.900
[Result of the Comparison]

37:07.320 --> 37:08.630
Now I announce that

37:08.880 --> 37:11.470
our Wantuo Group's

37:09.740 --> 37:11.540
[Evaluator, Wantuo Real Estate]

37:11.640 --> 37:13.350
[Xingrong Construction]

37:11.720 --> 37:13.050
West Coast Town Project

37:13.070 --> 37:14.280
will ultimately be entrusted to

37:13.350 --> 37:14.410
[Boxing Construction]

37:14.510 --> 37:15.410
[Evaluator, Wantuo Real Estate]

37:14.610 --> 37:15.360
Xingrong...

37:19.510 --> 37:20.650
[Xingrong Construction]

37:20.760 --> 37:22.350
[Boxing Construction]

37:25.830 --> 37:27.560
Do you have any manners? Hey...

37:30.240 --> 37:30.880
Mr. Zhang.

37:31.990 --> 37:32.720
Dad, you...

37:32.740 --> 37:33.940
Why are you here, Dad?

37:34.150 --> 37:34.680
Zhou Wan.

37:41.510 --> 37:42.170
Take a look.

37:43.020 --> 37:44.470
And you guys, too.

37:44.990 --> 37:47.050
How did you do the background checks?

37:47.630 --> 37:48.380
After this is over,

37:48.380 --> 37:50.310
all of you have to come to my office!

37:51.730 --> 37:52.720
If you want to quit your job,

37:52.720 --> 37:53.470
just tell me.

37:53.470 --> 37:54.600
I'll write a report.

38:00.610 --> 38:01.470
I announce that

38:02.340 --> 38:04.010
the West Coast Town Project

38:04.470 --> 38:06.760
will be entrusted to Boxing Construction.

38:05.860 --> 38:08.080
[Xingrong Construction]

38:09.720 --> 38:10.400
What?

38:10.400 --> 38:11.260
How can that be?

38:11.920 --> 38:12.590
Why?

38:13.780 --> 38:15.440
Isn't it quite embarrassing?

38:17.850 --> 38:18.990
Did you do something special,

38:18.990 --> 38:19.760
Ms. Zhou Wan?

38:21.400 --> 38:23.230
The rival company lost a lawsuit
the day before yesterday.

38:23.230 --> 38:24.960
Their building was rated as dangerous.

38:24.960 --> 38:25.800
Why didn't you tell me

38:25.800 --> 38:27.260
such an important matter?

38:27.510 --> 38:28.880
Their company
wasn't the primary defendant.

38:28.880 --> 38:30.030
The construction quality was fine,

38:30.030 --> 38:31.590
but the real estate developer
added an unauthorized extension,

38:31.590 --> 38:32.920
which implicated them.

38:32.980 --> 38:34.670
That's not really a stain on their record.

38:33.090 --> 38:36.270
[Boxing Construction]

38:35.670 --> 38:36.990
If it were Mr. Zhang Jr.,

38:36.990 --> 38:38.650
he would think the same as you.

38:38.660 --> 38:40.390
But Mr. Zhang Sr. is different.

38:41.280 --> 38:42.220
In the past few years,

38:42.220 --> 38:43.770
he has been getting ready to retire.

38:43.770 --> 38:46.080
He values reputations the most right now.

38:46.080 --> 38:47.420
The rival company
was afraid of being discovered,

38:47.420 --> 38:48.740
so they concealed the case.

38:48.740 --> 38:50.190
But Mr. Zhang Sr. just thought

38:49.370 --> 38:54.230
[Boxing Construction]

38:50.760 --> 38:52.440
they had lost basic integrity.

38:52.440 --> 38:55.110
He feared there might be hidden dangers
in their future cooperation.

38:55.110 --> 38:56.190
You can always handle things properly,

38:56.190 --> 38:56.950
Ms. Zhou Wan.

38:57.670 --> 38:59.920
You should have told us earlier.

38:59.920 --> 39:01.510
I only got the materials this morning,

39:01.510 --> 39:02.440
so I went to see

39:02.440 --> 39:04.070
Mr. Zhang Sr. at the last minute.

39:04.070 --> 39:04.960
However, Mr. Niu,

39:04.960 --> 39:05.840
with you being in charge here,

39:05.840 --> 39:06.960
it was certainly not a big problem.

39:06.960 --> 39:08.030
As your deputy,

39:08.030 --> 39:09.400
I should solve problems for you

39:09.400 --> 39:10.300
and add the finishing touch to your work.

39:10.300 --> 39:15.940
[Boxing Construction]

39:10.360 --> 39:11.020
Let me do it.

39:11.110 --> 39:12.600
Well, over these years,

39:12.880 --> 39:14.440
to some extent, you've learnt a lot

39:14.440 --> 39:15.880
as my subordinate.

39:16.030 --> 39:16.920
But after this,

39:17.030 --> 39:17.510
the Lanyue

39:17.510 --> 39:18.510
Resort Project

39:18.510 --> 39:20.070
is the top priority. Just after this...

39:20.070 --> 39:21.920
When it comes to rewards and punishments,
I'm quite impartial.

39:21.920 --> 39:23.030
Whatever happens by that time,

39:23.030 --> 39:23.890
just work hard,

39:23.900 --> 39:24.920
and everything can be discussed properly.

39:24.920 --> 39:25.320
After you.

39:25.320 --> 39:26.360
Thank you, Mr. Niu.

39:26.360 --> 39:27.150
You're welcome.

39:27.150 --> 39:28.750
I'll take a day off tomorrow.

39:29.070 --> 39:29.800
Ms. Zhou Wan.

39:29.960 --> 39:30.720
Since you joined the company,

39:30.720 --> 39:32.070
