39:32.070 --> 39:34.070
Why are you asking for a leave today?

39:34.070 --> 39:35.840
I need to pick someone up at the airport.

39:35.840 --> 39:36.360
Um?

39:37.150 --> 39:38.590
Who's this person that makes you even

39:38.590 --> 39:40.150
want to miss the celebration party?

39:40.150 --> 39:41.280
Someone important.

39:44.210 --> 39:46.060
I'm at the exit.

39:46.360 --> 39:47.810
Have you gotten off the shuttle bus?

39:47.810 --> 39:48.550
As soon as you come out,

39:48.550 --> 39:50.050
you'll be able to see me right away.

39:50.050 --> 39:52.600
[Int'l & Hong Kong/Macau/Taiwan Arrivals]

39:50.920 --> 39:51.840
I'm carrying my luggage

39:51.840 --> 39:52.770
and walking out.

39:57.510 --> 39:58.400
To celebrate my success in getting

39:58.400 --> 39:59.400
Wantuo's project

39:59.630 --> 40:01.290
and to celebrate your return,

40:01.320 --> 40:04.100
you can pick
whatever you want for dinner tonight.

40:04.100 --> 40:05.080
It's so simple, huh?

40:05.080 --> 40:06.340
Are you fobbing me off?

40:06.840 --> 40:08.040
Then what do you want?

40:08.760 --> 40:11.190
Aren't you tired after this whole flight?

40:11.670 --> 40:12.840
Am I tired?

40:12.840 --> 40:13.670
I'm a bit tired indeed.

40:13.670 --> 40:14.360
But we still have to

40:14.360 --> 40:15.720
handle the important stuff first,

40:15.720 --> 40:16.440
right?

40:19.190 --> 40:20.120
I can see you now.

40:21.660 --> 40:22.870
I can see you, too.

40:30.960 --> 40:32.030
Welcome back,

40:32.030 --> 40:32.880
Senior.

40:34.620 --> 40:36.820
You sound so distant calling me Senior.

40:38.560 --> 40:39.420
Mr. Jiang.

40:40.330 --> 40:44.310
[Int'l & Hong Kong/Macau/Taiwan Arrivals]

40:41.470 --> 40:41.880
Let's go.

40:41.880 --> 40:43.320
Let's go. What do you want to eat tonight?

40:43.320 --> 40:44.150
My treat.

40:44.420 --> 40:46.970
[Welcome Chinese Picasso
Back to China with Glory!]

40:47.720 --> 40:48.400
How is it?

40:48.630 --> 40:49.490
Are you surprised?

40:49.490 --> 40:50.840
-Is it unexpected?
-What exactly are you doing?

40:50.840 --> 40:51.900
What are you doing?

40:51.920 --> 40:52.760
What are you doing?

40:52.760 --> 40:54.290
What exactly are you doing?

40:54.470 --> 40:56.400
I've been running around for you
in China and abroad,

40:56.400 --> 40:57.630
taking care of both your career and life.

40:57.630 --> 40:58.990
So you just hit me as soon as we met?

40:58.990 --> 41:00.720
Put it away. Put it away at once.

41:01.150 --> 41:02.080
Eddie.

41:02.190 --> 41:02.880
Hello.

41:02.880 --> 41:04.040
Long time no see.

41:04.070 --> 41:05.440
Long time no see.

41:05.770 --> 41:07.500
I'm going to change my manager.

41:07.960 --> 41:09.150
Do you even have any humanity?

41:09.150 --> 41:10.770
-Carry the suitcase.
-Lu Xixiao.

41:10.770 --> 41:11.910
Thank you so much.

41:12.440 --> 41:14.240
You came all the way from France.

41:14.280 --> 41:15.160
Come on.

41:15.320 --> 41:16.320
Don't mention it.

41:16.320 --> 41:18.210
We've worked together so many times.

41:18.210 --> 41:19.250
We're family now.

41:19.280 --> 41:19.950
Well,

41:20.070 --> 41:23.190
that's why I got to count on you this time
for the exhibition.

41:23.190 --> 41:24.070
Stop chatting.

41:24.090 --> 41:25.350
What will we eat later?

41:26.030 --> 41:26.760
What will we eat?

41:26.760 --> 41:28.290
Didn't you say
you would treat me to a big meal?

41:28.290 --> 41:34.260
[Unchangeable Fate]
